# Software-factory scratch: plans, reviews, and gate logs for one run. Ignored
# here rather than only in the checkout the factory runs in, so bin/check-gates'
# scratch copy - which reads tracked and untracked-but-not-ignored files - never
# picks up a run's artefacts.
/.factory/run/
